71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GHrttRdUQAkQ7kNvwEkzvAO&_nc_oc=Adqil5Ofl7T3V4acV1HmI6zL5RtHxaKq7LtdcDMI9Bh29qIWLmxM7Q81IJLNpuYjgmQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrfcXWHkN_vy-AOxbIEZL7245ufmy7H4x3Xb-V-rrKew&oe=6AF34FF9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=18hmRnZKMZYQ7kNvwFS1OP0&_nc_oc=AdoBNwTGxWYiwYa49zuXrXrybQ3VE0XP1nSJ0nV3rlHlo7dqqA8gW5Al6hM1d_xITEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSH_GFLKVJtla1ttkOera8vMvGIz1IENv3z5eyzYBSBkQ&oe=6AF32A93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mymgsmeqoQUQ7kNvwFp5wL-&_nc_oc=Adpp14eXYpsXW1PtcCPxOborXeaf9fQ6pJA386mBtFo9pSuHlyORQBGRuWiKo4wdYXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSe0H2p9Pimel7-RX84FELLUvDDa4BhKuSEwl0aUZignw&oe=6AF328DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: